When I get wishes as a Monk, I usually go for the half-damage
artifacts, which differ depending on which alignment you are. 'blessed
Orb of Fate' for neutrals and 'blessed Master Key Of Thievery' for
chaotics. 'blessed Platinum Yendorian Express Card' will give you
telepathy, magic resistance, and free charging, and is overall a very
useful thing to have. Are you adhering to weaponless conduct? If not,
try 'blessed fixed +3 Staff of Aesculapius'. That weapon in particular
helps out a lot in the early to mid game, but craps out later on when
it loses double damage to the undead. 'blessed fixed +3 gauntlets of
power' and 'blessed fixed +3 speed boots' are also very helpful, and
were part of my AK when I ascended a monk. I'm way behind on YAAP's, I
still have to type them up for a B, T, and M. :)

